        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Elegant Reed Glass Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing the most beautiful custom door pulls for homes, right here is the U.S.A. Dress up your glass shower doors with these pulls made of solid brass and hand finished in your choice of 10 different high quality finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/traditional-smooth-glass-shower-door-pull-pair-first-impressions-sd-gnt625smtsbr\"><b>First Impressions Model #810S/8/8 Smooth Shower Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBelow is a picture of the highly detailed reed design.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/810R-pull-detail-view.jpg?v=1704354553\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 810R pull detail view\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions FII-SD-810R/8/x  Glass Shower Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 10</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis shower door pull is <b>Available in 5 lengths</b>.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-SD-810R/8/5C2C:  Mounting Center to Center 5\" - Total Length 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-810R/8/6C2C:  Mounting Center to Center 6\" - Total Length 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-810R/8/8C2C:  Mounting Center to Center 8\" - Total Length 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-810R/8/12C2C:  Mounting Center to Center 12\" - Total Length 14-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-SD-810R/8/16C2C:  Mounting Center to Center 16\" - Total Length 18-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These Reed Glass Door Pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 2 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elegant Reed Glass Shower Door Pulls 8 - 18 Inches, Pair, FII-SD-810R/8/x",
                "description": "First Impressions 810R/8 - These elegantly reed designed solid brass shower door pulls are available in many finishes including polished chrome, oil rubbed bronze, antique brass and satin nickel. They are offered in 5 sizes of 8 to 18 inches.",
